{"OptimizedCursorPaginator should inherit from Paginator instead of BasePaginator to avoid duplicating the get_item_key and value_from_cursor methods": 0.06796465814113617, "The get_result method in OptimizedCursorPaginator is almost a line-by-line copy of BasePaginator.get_result, creating significant maintenance risk - should refactor to avoid duplication, possibly by introducing a new method in the base class for slicing logic": 0.10482841730117798, "The if/else block for selecting the paginator has duplicated code between branches that can be simplified": 0.02672872692346573, "The maximum span count 1000 is hardcoded in the Lua script - should be passed as an argument from Python code to make it configurable and consistent with max_segment_spans in SpansBuffer": 0.47759318351745605}